                <rubric>Notes</rubric>
                <paragraph>Here, a “config” is a dynamically-generated dataclass type that is designed to be
                    compatible with Hydra <reference ids="id3" internal="1" refid="rcd3092d0866d-1">[1]</reference>.</paragraph>
                <paragraph>The configs produced by <literal>just(&lt;type_or_func&gt;)</literal> introduce an explicit dependency
                    on hydra-zen. I.e. hydra-zen must be installed in order to instantiate any config
                    that used <reference internal="1" refid="hydra_zen.just" reftitle="hydra_zen.just"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">just</literal></reference>.</paragraph>
